{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.geographica.IndoorSDK\/documentation\/IndoorSDK"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"IndoorSDK is an indoor map, position and navigation framework.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Step 1: Add frameworks to your App","anchor":"Step-1-Add-frameworks-to-your-App","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Add the package to your project. In Xcode open ‘File’ menu and select ‘Add Packages…’ in the Swift Packages screen, search ‘aena-xcframework’ or use the url https:\/\/github.com\/CartoDB\/aena-xcframework to find, and add the package.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Step 2: Requiered Keys to add at “info.plist”","anchor":"Step-2-Requiered-Keys-to-add-at-infoplist","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In the info.plist of your project you must add the following keys and its proper value.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Privacy - Location When In Use Usage Description","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Privacy - Bluetooth Always Usage Description","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In both add a message that tells the user than the app is requesting access to the user’s location information while the app is running.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Step 3: Background Modes","anchor":"Step-3-Background-Modes","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Signing & Capabilities","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" of your project settings, add ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Background Modes","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" and select the modes according to the next image.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent